{"id":"626559","name":"鲜肉香菜水饺","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/626559/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"600克"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"400克"},{"name":"猪肉糜","amount":"450克"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"200克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1棵"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉和清水和成软硬适中的面团，静置饧面。","img":"images/626559/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香菜清洗干净，控干水分备用。","img":"images/626559/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉糜放入盆中加入一颗生鸡蛋、十三香粉、豆瓣酱、酱油、蚝油和盐。","img":"images/626559/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香菇焯水切碎，大葱切碎，两个鸡蛋炒碎，一同放入馅料盆里，淋入芝麻油。","img":"images/626559/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"香菜切碎，拌匀即可。","img":"images/626559/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面团移至面板，分成小剂子。","img":"images/626559/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一份擀成圆片。","img":"images/626559/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放上适量馅料。","img":"images/626559/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包成自己喜欢的饺子。","img":"images/626559/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"依次完成。","img":"images/626559/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"开水下锅，煮熟捞出。","img":"images/626559/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"好吃不停口。","img":"images/626559/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}